Corn Delight (Horizon port)
===========================

This port's own files (Rust code, tools, declarations, documentation) are MIT licensed (see LICENSE).

Corn Delight
------------
Data, assets and item values are carried or adapted from Corn Delight
(https://github.com/0999312/Corn-Delight, branch 1.21, commit
ab03743e53319e985f134d15a0473ff1329c5e0a, version 1.1.8-1.21.1),
MIT License, Copyright (c) 2022 Zheng Syameimaru. Full text: LICENSE-corn_delight
(also third_party/corn_delight/LICENSE).

Mysterious Mountain Lib (MMLib, https://github.com/0999312/MMLib, commit
8deb5c2fde32d1424a268d091fca2fe4c1bd7879), the library Corn Delight builds on, has no
licence file. Its behaviour (two-block crops, loot table injection, villager food) is
re-implemented here from observed behaviour; none of its code or assets is copied.

Farmer's Delight
----------------
This add-on needs the Farmer's Delight Horizon port (ported_farmersdelight), which
carries Farmer's Delight Refabricated under MIT (see that mod's NOTICE), and calls
its public Rust API.

No vanilla Minecraft assets are extracted or redistributed.
